# Project Ownership

## Primary Maintainer
- **GitHub**: @kadragon
- **Role**: Project Lead, Primary Developer
- **Responsibilities**: Architecture, feature development, code review

## Review Requirements
- All changes require maintainer review
- Critical changes (security, architecture) require extended review

## Escalation
For questions or issues:
1. Create GitHub issue in project repository
2. Tag @kadragon for maintainer attention
3. For urgent matters, contact via organization channels

## Contribution Guidelines
1. Fork repository and create feature branch
2. Follow SDD×TDD workflow (see .agents/profiles/)
3. Ensure all tests pass and coverage maintained
4. Submit PR with spec reference (SPEC-XXX-ID)
5. Wait for maintainer review and approval

## Code Review Standards
- Code quality gates must pass (ruff, mypy, bandit)
- Test coverage ≥80%
- Spec traceability maintained
- Documentation updated
